sentences.t:
Ceu quondam torto volitans sub verbere turbo,
quem pueri magno in gyro vacua atria circum
intenti ludo exercent;

sentences.l:
As sometimes, flying under the twisted lash, a top,
which boys in a great circle round the empty halls,
intent on their game, keep driving;

