sentences.t:
Locus Ardea quondam
dictus avis, et nunc magnum manet Ardea nomen,
sed fortuna fuit;

sentences.l:
The place Ardea once
was called by our grandfathers, and still great remains Ardea, the name,
but its fortune is past;
